<%
  details = [
    ["Policy Number", @policy.policy_number],
    ["Plan", @policy.plan_name],
    ["Insurer", @policy.insurance_company_name],
    ["Policy Type", @policy.policy_type],
    ["Sum Insured", (@policy.respond_to?(:sum_insured) && @policy.sum_insured.present? ? "Rs. #{'%.2f' % @policy.sum_insured}" : nil)],
    ["Premium", (@policy.respond_to?(:total_premium) && @policy.total_premium.present? ? "Rs. #{'%.2f' % @policy.total_premium}" : nil)],
    ["Payment Mode", @policy.payment_mode],
    ["Policy Start Date", (@policy.respond_to?(:policy_start_date) && @policy.policy_start_date.present? ? @policy.policy_start_date.strftime("%d %b %Y") : nil)],
    ["Policy End Date", @policy.policy_end_date.strftime("%d %b %Y")]
  ].select { |_, value| value.present? }
%>
Dear <%= @customer.display_name %>,

<% if @days_remaining.zero? -%>
We're writing to let you know that your <%= @policy_category %> policy, bearing policy number <%= @policy.policy_number %> under the <%= @policy.plan_name %> plan<% if @policy.insurance_company_name.present? %> with <%= @policy.insurance_company_name %><% end %>, officially expired today on <%= @policy.policy_end_date.strftime("%d %b %Y") %>, which means your coverage is no longer active as of this moment. We strongly recommend that you get in touch with us or your agent at the earliest to renew this policy, so that you and your loved ones are not left without protection in case of an unexpected event, and so that any ongoing benefits tied to this plan are not disrupted any further.
<% else -%>
We wanted to personally reach out and remind you that your <%= @policy_category %> policy, bearing policy number <%= @policy.policy_number %> under the <%= @policy.plan_name %> plan<% if @policy.insurance_company_name.present? %> with <%= @policy.insurance_company_name %><% end %>, is scheduled to expire on <%= @policy.policy_end_date.strftime("%d %b %Y") %>, which is just <%= @days_remaining %> <%= @days_remaining == 1 ? "day" : "days" %> away from today. To make sure your coverage continues without any interruption and you remain protected against life's uncertainties, we encourage you to complete the renewal process well ahead of this date, since even a brief lapse in coverage could leave you without the financial protection this policy is meant to provide.
<% end -%>

Policy Details
--------------
<% details.each do |label, value| -%>
<%= "#{label}:".ljust(20) %><%= value %>
<% end -%>

<% if @agent.present? -%>
Need help renewing? Contact your agent, <%= @agent.full_name %> - <%= @agent.mobile %><% if @agent.email.present? %> - <%= @agent.email %><% end %>

<% end -%>
Thank you,
Drwise Team
